# Trained models
# Model artifacts are large and are produced by training/train.py, so the
# output directories are ignored. Note this is deliberately scoped to those
# directories: a blanket *.json / *.parquet / *.npy rule here would also
# silently exclude a small demo model that is meant to be committed.
/models/
/models_*/

# Training datasets (large source CSVs, e.g. the TMDB dump)
*.csv

# Pickled artifacts -- never commit these; unpickling is code execution.
*.pkl
